# Data SL Consulting toolkit

Full instructions: see `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

## API facts

- REST base URL: `https://data-slconsulting.com/wp-json/datasl/v1` (read-only, public, no authentication). OpenAPI 3.1: https://data-slconsulting.com/openapi.json
- Routes: `GET /offres` (filters `cible`, `categorie`, `champs`), `GET /offres/{slug}`, `GET /cabinet`, `GET /contact`; search: `GET /wp-json/wp/v2/search?search=...`
- MCP server: `https://data-slconsulting.com/api/mcp-server` (Streamable HTTP; tools `get_offers`, `search_site`, `fetch_page`).
- Errors: JSON `{"code", "message", "data": {"status", "hint"}}`; show `hint` to the user.
- Rate limit: 120 requests per minute per IP (`RateLimit-Policy`, `RateLimit` headers); on 429, wait `Retry-After` seconds.

## Rules

- Keep `js/` and `python/` dependency-free and behaviourally identical (same commands, `--json` output, exit codes 0/1/2).
- Validate inputs before any network call; `lire` only reads pages of data-slconsulting.com.
- Never hard-code prices or offers: the API is the source of truth.
- User-facing text stays in French.
- Run `cd js && npm test` and `cd python && PYTHONPATH=src python -m unittest discover -s tests` before proposing a change.
